    "text": "Alamosa Valley Courier\nwebsite\nPagosa Springs\nCentauri back on track after win over Pagosa\nBy KEN HAMRICK, Courier sports editor,\n17 hours agoLA JARA – After a tough three-set loss to second-ranked Alamosa last Tuesday, the seventh-ranked Centauri High School volleyball team got its season going in the right direction after wins at Pueblo East on Friday and Pagosa Springs at home on Saturday. The Pagosa Springs scores were 25-17, 25-3...",
